ve palette RAM on the card (it reported palette 0 slot 0 as `$22` periwinkle while `read_memory palette` showed `$0F` black); I used the raw palette RAM and rendered pixel samples as ground truth. (The web lookups returned nothing usable — the Data Crystal RAM map gave HTTP 403 — so every fact above came from the emulator.) The emulator is left paused on World 1-2."}
